|---|---|---|---|
| `internal/install` | 609.117 s | 1800 s | 2.96× |
| `internal/install/atomicity` | **1422.407 s** | 1800 s | **1.27×** |

`-timeout` is per test binary, so 1422.407 s does fit inside 1800 s — **but it was measured on a
